      "message": "build: drop the unused camcraft-gcode workspace dependency\n\nPR #3657 declared camcraft-gcode in [workspace.dependencies], but no\ncrate depends on it yet, so every cargo command warned. The crate stays\na workspace member; the first crate that uses it (#2218) adds the entry\nback with its decision record.\n\nFixes #3955\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
